# Skills CLI

Install only to Cursor and Claude Code:

```
npx skills add <pkg> -g -y --agent cursor --agent claude-code
```

mattpocock in-progress (`retro` and friends): add `--full-depth`. Never `--agent "*"`. Prefer `npx skills ls -g` over `--json` unless a script is parsing it.
